{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2807-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>{'translated': '兩日前（10日），民政事務總署公布「主教山優化計劃」，將分階段清拆在深水埗主教山上存在多年的違建構築物。第一階段涵蓋由山腳至棠蔭街山坡休憩處山頂一帶，第二階段則涵蓋由山腳至巴域街附近山頂一帶。'}</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2834-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>{'translated': '目前第二階段範圍仍保留部分健身器材及雕塑，現場可見居民在踢毽、打乒乓球及使用健身設施。至於棠蔭街山坡休憩處一帶，則於昨晚已用鐵絲網及圍板圍封，今早有保安駐守，防止居民進入。'}</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_3017-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2999-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2938-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2637-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2292-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2304-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2303-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2572-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2651-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2567-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2671-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2667-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2495-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2508-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2465-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Payme-500x237.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T03:59:55.831985+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":18,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"none"}}